<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::outbound_investment_flow" target="ai_market_cyber_instabil::ai_capital_availability" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher cross-border outbound investment by domestic actors translates into more equity and project financing directed at foreign AI startups, data centers and fabs, directly increasing available capital for AI buildout in recipient markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_market_cyber_instabil</data>
