  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A fall in Chinese outbound investment reduces financing for Iranian export infrastructure (terminals, pipelines, tankers and servicing), leading to capacity and logistics shortfalls that lower physical oil export volumes.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
