<edge source="ai_market_cyber_instabil::counterparty_concentrati" target="france_euro_bond_crisis::contagion_transmission" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">High concentration of critical AI/cloud providers means a single provider outage, regulatory sanction, or exploit transmits synchronized losses across multiple financial institutions and corporates, accelerating and intensifying cross‑border sovereign stress transmission including into French bonds.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_market_cyber_instabil</data>
  <data key="d39">france_euro_bond_crisis</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ai_market_cyber_instabil::counterparty_concentrati" target="iran_gulf_standoff::insurance_premium" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater concentration of critical AI/cloud/satellite providers or financiers creates a single-point systemic exposure—insurers facing correlated loss scenarios from an outage or attack repricing war/political-risk cover for Gulf shipping and raising average premiums.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_market_cyber_instabil</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_standoff</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ai_market_cyber_instabil::counterparty_concentrati" target="russia_ukraine_war::private_net_access_contr" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">When critical AI and comms services are concentrated in a few firms those firms can unilaterally throttle, deny, or re-route commercial network access in the conflict zone via contract or API policies, directly increasing private control over access.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_market_cyber_instabil</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ai_market_cyber_instabil::counterparty_concentrati" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::chain_diversification" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater concentration of critical AI infrastructure or services in a few vendors creates clear single‑point vulnerabilities that prompt corporate procurement teams and policymakers to reconfigure supplier networks and accelerate diversification away from those counterparties.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_market_cyber_instabil</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
