  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in sovereign bond yields raise corporate borrowing costs and discount rates, causing companies to postpone capital‑intensive model training and large-scale infrastructure procurement, which slows near‑term growth in compute demand for AI.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">france_euro_bond_crisis</data>
