  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in French sovereign yields forces budgetary and operational retrenchment that leads France to reduce naval patrols and escort missions in the Gulf, lowering deterrence and enabling a higher frequency of attacks on commercial shipping.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
