  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp increases in French sovereign bond yields redirect executive attention and resources toward financial stabilization and crisis management, reducing the frequency and intensity of diplomatic initiatives related to the Russia–Ukraine conflict.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">france_euro_bond_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
