<edge source="france_euro_bond_crisis::contagion_transmission" target="ai_market_cyber_instabil::counterparty_concentrati" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster contagion of sovereign stress across markets forces smaller regional datacenter operators, niche cloud providers and specialty financiers to curtail operations or exit, driving customers and projects to a smaller set of large global providers and thereby increasing counterparty concentration.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">france_euro_bond_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_market_cyber_instabil</data>
</edge>
<edge source="france_euro_bond_crisis::contagion_transmission" target="iran_gulf_standoff::crude_price_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Faster transmission of euro-area financial stress into global markets amplifies risk premia and safe‑haven flows, which push benchmark crude prices up as markets price in higher supply‑disruption and financing risk tied to the Gulf.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">france_euro_bond_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_standoff</data>
</edge>
<edge source="france_euro_bond_crisis::contagion_transmission" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::chain_diversification" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid, visible transmission of euro-area sovereign stress to other markets prompts multinational firms and procurement officials to accelerate re-sourcing away from concentrated suppliers (including China) to reduce systemic exposure, driving measurable short-term supply‑chain diversification.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">france_euro_bond_crisis</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
