<edge source="france_euro_bond_crisis::portfolio_rebalancing_ra" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::export_control_intensity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Investor reallocation out of European sovereigns into US financial and technology assets boosts the capital base and political leverage of US strategic-tech industries and supportive lawmakers, enabling and incentivizing broader or stricter export‑control measures on China over the medium term.</data>
